{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"liusima-e-o267","title":"杨沛捽无疏之中黄门，黄门裂坏衣帻逸去","accounts":[{"id":"liusima-a-143639734436cbafe5d7","label":"裴注·魏略列传","text":"杨沛捽无疏之中黄门，黄门裂坏衣帻逸去","evidence":["liusima-q-4beb15afe2441bace394"]},{"id":"liusima-a-2663a29a4cc1eef80fa2","label":"裴注·魏略列传","text":"中黄门自诉于太祖，太祖曰汝不死为幸，沛声名益振","evidence":["liusima-q-1abf8df489477a36db2a"]}],"participants":[{"person":"liusima-p0039","role":"问中黄门有疏邪，云无疏，怒曰何知汝不欲逃邪，遂使人捽其头，与杖欲捶之；由是声名益振","evidence":["liusima-q-4beb15afe2441bace394","liusima-q-1abf8df489477a36db2a"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"曰汝不死为幸矣","evidence":["liusima-q-1abf8df489477a36db2a"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["liusima-q-4beb15afe2441bace394","liusima-q-1abf8df489477a36db2a"]},"ordering_evidence":"liusima-q-4beb15afe2441bace394","source_order":[15,302,403],"order":3379}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"liusima-p0039","name":"杨沛","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"liusima-q-1abf8df489477a36db2a","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-917aeff0af2d8ac16c44","layer":"pei","quote":"自诉于太祖。太祖曰：‘汝不死为幸矣！’由是声名益振","attribution":"裴注·魏略列传","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":301,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-aaaf08e9bea919e96c3f","start":513,"end":538,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"liusima-q-4beb15afe2441bace394","section":"chapter-015","block":"b-917aeff0af2d8ac16c44","layer":"pei","quote":"太祖已南过，其余未毕。而中黄门前渡，忘持行轩，私北还取之；从吏求小船，欲独先渡。吏呵不肯，黄门与吏争言。沛问黄门：‘有疏邪？’黄门云：‘无疏。’沛怒曰：‘何知汝不欲逃邪？’遂使人捽其头，与杖欲捶之；而逸得去，衣帻皆裂坏","attribution":"裴注·魏略列传","section_title":"刘司马梁张温贾传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0035.xhtml","index":301,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-aaaf08e9bea919e96c3f","start":403,"end":512,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
